<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Auxiliary Lemmas</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Proof of Proposition <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Additional Related Works</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Derivation of the Finite Difference Estimator in Equation (<span class="ltx_ref"></span>)</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Appendix G Derivation of the Finite Difference Estimator in Equation () ‣ Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 1: Square both sides.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Appendix G Derivation of the Finite Difference Estimator in Equation () ‣ Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Step 2: Take expectation over <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A7.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix G Derivation of the Finite Difference Estimator in Equation () ‣ Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Rademacher case.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A7.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix G Derivation of the Finite Difference Estimator in Equation () ‣ Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Gaussian case.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A7.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix G Derivation of the Finite Difference Estimator in Equation () ‣ Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conclusion.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Derivation of the Gibbs Distribution (<span class="ltx_ref"></span>)</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In Unveiling m-Sharpness Through the Structure of Stochastic Gradient Noise" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Algorithm: Reweighted-SAM</span></a></li>
